      en: ["Central import terminal for all petroleum products in the country.", "Located in the Kissy neighborhood in eastern Freetown.", "Possesses a storage capacity of tens of thousands of cubic meters.", "Primary supply point for fuel for Lungi International Airport.", "Regulated and monitored by the Petroleum Regulatory Agency (PRA).", "Features specialized facilities for handling liquid fuel shipments."],
